{"version":1,"content":"<p>【重大突破 😱】由馬斯克（Elon Musk）創立的神經科技公司 Neuralink 迎來人體臨床試驗的新里程碑。</p><p>首位植入 Neuralink N1 晶片的四肢癱瘓受試者 Noland Arbaugh，近日成功展示僅憑「意念」即可直接驅動並轉向電動輪椅，象徵大腦與外部機械裝置的整合技術已從純數碼屏幕操作，進一步拓展至實體空間的自主行動領域。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:21:10.401307+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:08:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:58:18.694504+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:18:46.253516+00:00","content_hash":"95f8d68ab3f0da744791a4674ae37e924ad0c2b5d38922a048742a5740a17cc2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}